      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.74,
      "end_seconds": 54.06,
      "duration_seconds": 8.32,
      "text": "Hmm, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. And And there's blurry vision as well, six months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
