      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.5,
      "end_seconds": 187.04,
      "duration_seconds": 13.54,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I look after my grandchildren most days. No, I share a house with my brother"
