      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.92,
      "end_seconds": 302.65,
      "duration_seconds": 19.73,
      "text": "Right, thank you. What I'm giving you is metformin, 500 milligrams, once a day with food, long term. That should help with high blood sugar. Book a review after the blood results. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
